→ BCI-ADL  
→ HAEB (DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.18616470)

## For Researchers

If you are studying human-AI boundary conditions:
→ HÚPLŃ  
→ Sovereign Sensation  
→ Bio-Resilience Foundation


